heatmap of the board and a list of the best moves.</p><!----></article><!--]--></div></div><div class=\"grid-3 item\" data-v-fe84172d=\"\"><div class=\"VPLink no-icon VPFeature\" data-v-fe84172d=\"\" data-v-2b52cee3=\"\"><!--[--><article class=\"box\" data-v-2b52cee3=\"\"><div class=\"icon\" data-v-2b52cee3=\"\">📁</div><h2 class=\"title\" data-v-2b52cee3=\"\">Personal database</h2><p class=\"details\" data-v-2b52cee3=\"\">Do you play both in Lichess and Chess.com? With En Croissant, you can easily import your games from both platforms and keep them up to date in a single place.</p><!----></article><!--]--></div></div><div class=\"grid-3 item\" data-v-fe84172d=\"\"><div class=\"VPLink no-icon VPFeature\" data-v-fe84172d=\"\" data-v-2b52cee3=\"\"><!--[--><article class=\"box\" data-v-2b52cee3=\"\"><div class=\"icon\" data-v-2b52cee3=\"\">📥</div><h2 class=\"title\" data-v-2b52cee3=\"\">Download manager</h2><p class=\"details\" data-v-2b52cee3=\"\">En Croissant comes with a built-in download manager that allows you to get the latest engines and databases with a single click.</p><!----></article><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div></div><!--[--><!--]--><div class=\"vp-doc container\" style=\"\" data-v-6fb16c8d=\"\" data-v-01d6c2d2=\"\"><!--[--><div style=\"position:relative;\" data-v-6fb16c8d=\"\"><div><figure class=\"_showcase_tp4xm_2\"><img src=\"/showcase.webp\" alt=\"Board\" width=\"1550\"><figcaption> En Croissant's analysis screen </figcaption></figure></div></div><!--]--></div></div></div><!----><!--[--><!--]--></div></div>\n    <script>window.__VP_HASH_MAP__=JSON.parse(\"{\\\"docs_assets_databases.md\\\":\\\"CNkWG9hT\\\",\\\"docs_assets_engines.md\\\":\\\"D8h1pQpV\\\",\\\"docs_getting-started.md\\\":\\\"D8Q-fvDc\\\",\\\"docs_guides_analyze-game.md\\\":\\\"D-2pMUzV\\\",\\\"docs_guides_configure-engines.md\\\":\\\"CYiX1Io7\\\",\\\"docs_guides_manage-repertoire.md\\\":\\\"CgCr4uwF\\\",\\\"docs_index.md\\\":\\\"DxV4eGdF\\\",\\\"docs_reference_database-format.md\\